Debian packages and the Python base image (container image)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Docker image is built on the official python image and installs git,
openssh-client and ca-certificates from Debian. They are unmodified, run as
separate programs, and keep their own licenses (see /usr/share/doc/*/copyright
in the image).

